# LLVM style
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++03

IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 80
IndentCaseLabels: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: true
SeparateDefinitionBlocks: Always
ReflowComments: false

# Include organization
SortIncludes: true
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
